# FileStudio 换行符与文件类型策略
#
# 目标：跨平台协作时避免整仓出现 CRLF/LF 混用导致的无谓 diff。
# 约定：仓库内一律以 LF 存储；仅 Windows 批处理脚本例外（CRLF）。
#
# 说明：本仓库在 Windows + core.autocrlf=true 下开发，提交前若不做规范化，
#       每个文件都会触发 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告。

# ---- 默认：文本文件，仓库内与检出均为 LF ----
*               text=auto eol=lf

# ---- Windows 批处理：必须 CRLF ----
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf
gradlew.bat     text eol=crlf

# ---- POSIX shell 脚本：必须 LF，否则报 "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M" ----
gradlew         text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：禁止换行符转换与差异对比 ----
# Gradle / 构建产物
*.jar           binary
*.zip           binary
*.gz            binary
*.tar           binary
*.class         binary
# 图片
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.bmp           binary
*.ico           binary
*.webp          binary
# 字体
*.ttf           binary
*.otf           binary
*.woff          binary
*.woff2         binary
# 音视频（本项目按容器解析，需保证字节精确）
*.mp4           binary
*.mov           binary
*.mkv           binary
*.webm          binary
*.avi           binary
*.mp3           binary
*.wav           binary
*.flac          binary
# 文档与密钥
*.pdf           binary
*.p12           binary
*.pfx           binary
*.der           binary
*.crt           binary
*.cer           binary
*.keystore      binary
# 数据库
*.sqlite        binary
*.sqlite3       binary
*.db            binary
*.db3           binary
*.parquet       binary

# ---- 合并冲突时优先保留 ----
*.md            text eol=lf merge=union
*.txt           text eol=lf
